{"seq":3,"slug":"render-pipeline","title":"渲染管线与绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/rendering/render-pipeline","wordCount":1186,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"渲染管线与绘制\">渲染管线与绘制</h1><p>前两篇分别准备好了数据（缓冲区与绑定组）与程序（WGSL 着色器），这一篇负责把它们组装成一个能真正产出像素的整体，并发出绘制命令。WebGPU 的渲染管线是一个不可变的状态对象：你在创建时一次性描述完所有渲染状态——用哪段着色器、顶点数据长什么样、画的是三角形还是线、深度怎么测、颜色怎么混——之后这个管线就固定下来，渲染时只需绑定它并发命令。这种「预先描述、运行期不变」的设计是 WebGPU 性能可预测的根源，也是渲染章的收口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>渲染管线对象（<code>GPURenderPipeline</code>）把 <a href=\"../foundations/gpu-pipeline-model\">GPU 管线模型</a> 里那条「顶点→光栅化→片元」的固定流水线的所有可配置参数冻结成一个不可变快照。WebGL 时代这些状态散落在几十个全局函数调用里、随时可改、难以追踪；WebGPU 把它们收拢进一个描述符，浏览器在创建时一次性校验并优化。代价是你不能事后改某一项——要换状态就得换管线，但这在实践中反而让性能行为清晰可控。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[着色器模块 WGSL] --&gt; P[GPURenderPipeline 描述符]&#10;  B[顶点缓冲布局&lt;br/&gt;vertex layout] --&gt; P&#10;  C[图元拓扑&lt;br/&gt;topology] --&gt; P&#10;  D[深度模板状态] --&gt; P&#10;  E[混合状态&lt;br/&gt;blend] --&gt; P&#10;  F[管线布局&lt;br/&gt;绑定组布局] --&gt; P&#10;  P --&gt; G[渲染通道 beginRenderPass]&#10;  G --&gt; H[setPipeline / setBindGroup / setVertexBuffer]&#10;  H --&gt; I[draw / drawIndexed]&#10;  I --&gt; J[encoder.finish → queue.submit]\">flowchart TD\n  A[着色器模块 WGSL] --&gt; P[GPURenderPipeline 描述符]\n  B[顶点缓冲布局&lt;br/&gt;vertex layout] --&gt; P\n  C[图元拓扑&lt;br/&gt;topology] --&gt; P\n  D[深度模板状态] --&gt; P\n  E[混合状态&lt;br/&gt;blend] --&gt; P\n  F[管线布局&lt;br/&gt;绑定组布局] --&gt; P\n  P --&gt; G[渲染通道 beginRenderPass]\n  G --&gt; H[setPipeline / setBindGroup / setVertexBuffer]\n  H --&gt; I[draw / drawIndexed]\n  I --&gt; J[encoder.finish → queue.submit]</pre><p>整条链路的终点呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/device-adapter\">适配器与设备</a> 里的提交骨架：所有绘制命令最终录制进命令编码器，提交给队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装配渲染管线\">装配渲染管线</h2><p>渲染管线描述符由几个关键部分组成，每一部分都对接前面某篇文档的概念。<code>vertex</code> 部分指定顶点着色器入口与顶点缓冲布局，其 <code>@location</code> 必须与 <a href=\"shaders-wgsl\">着色器与 WGSL</a> 里顶点入口的 <code>@location</code> 对齐；<code>fragment</code> 部分指定片元着色器入口与输出的颜色目标格式；<code>primitive</code> 决定图元拓扑；<code>layout</code> 引用 <a href=\"buffers-bindings\">缓冲区与绑定组</a> 里定义的绑定组布局。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const pipeline = device.createRenderPipeline({&#10;  layout: pipelineLayout, // 由 bindGroupLayout 组装而来&#10;  vertex: {&#10;    module: shaderModule,&#10;    entryPoint: &#39;vs_main&#39;,&#10;    buffers: [&#10;      {&#10;        arrayStride: 24, // 6 个 float = 24 字节&#10;        attributes: [&#10;          { shaderLocation: 0, offset: 0, format: &#39;float32x3&#39; }, // 位置&#10;          { shaderLocation: 1, offset: 12, format: &#39;float32x3&#39; }, // 颜色&#10;        ],&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;  fragment: {&#10;    module: shaderModule,&#10;    entryPoint: &#39;fs_main&#39;,&#10;    targets: [{ format: presentationFormat }],&#10;  },&#10;  primitive: { topology: &#39;triangle-list&#39; },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createRenderPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  layout: pipelineLayout, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 由 bindGroupLayout 组装而来</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vertex: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    module: shaderModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entryPoint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vs_main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buffers: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        arrayStride: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 6 个 float = 24 字节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        attributes: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { shaderLocation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'float32x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { shaderLocation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'float32x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 颜色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fragment: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    module: shaderModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entryPoint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fs_main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    targets: [{ format: presentationFormat }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  primitive: { topology: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'triangle-list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>arrayStride</code> 与 <code>offset</code> 必须与你写进顶点缓冲的内存布局精确一致——这是最容易出错的地方，错位会让三角形扭曲或消失。下表归纳管线各部分与其他文档的对应关系，便于交叉检查。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管线部分</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>必须对齐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>vertex.buffers</code></td>\n<td>顶点数据内存布局</td>\n<td>WGSL 顶点入口的 <code>@location</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vertex.module</code> / <code>fragment.module</code></td>\n<td>着色器程序</td>\n<td><a href=\"shaders-wgsl\">着色器与 WGSL</a> 入口名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fragment.targets</code></td>\n<td>输出颜色格式</td>\n<td>渲染通道颜色附件格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>primitive.topology</code></td>\n<td>图元类型</td>\n<td>顶点数据的组织方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>layout</code></td>\n<td>绑定组契约</td>\n<td><a href=\"buffers-bindings\">缓冲区与绑定组</a> 的布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>depthStencil</code></td>\n<td>深度/模板测试</td>\n<td>深度纹理格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"渲染通道与绘制命令\">渲染通道与绘制命令</h2><p>有了管线，绘制发生在一个渲染通道（render pass）里。渲染通道开始时要声明颜色附件（画到哪张纹理）与可选的深度附件，以及每个附件在开始时是清空还是保留（<code>loadOp</code>）、结束时是否存储（<code>storeOp</code>）。通道内部的命令序列很固定：设管线、设绑定组、设顶点/索引缓冲、发绘制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const encoder = device.createCommandEncoder();&#10;const pass = encoder.beginRenderPass({&#10;  colorAttachments: [&#10;    {&#10;      view: context.getCurrentTexture().createView(),&#10;      clearValue: { r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1 },&#10;      loadOp: &#39;clear&#39;,&#10;      storeOp: &#39;store&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;});&#10;pass.setPipeline(pipeline);&#10;pass.setBindGroup(0, bindGroup);&#10;pass.setVertexBuffer(0, vertexBuffer);&#10;pass.draw(3); // 画 3 个顶点 = 1 个三角形&#10;pass.end();&#10;device.queue.submit([encoder.finish()]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> encoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createCommandEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginRenderPass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  colorAttachments: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      view: context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCurrentTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      clearValue: { r: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, g: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, b: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, a: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      loadOp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      storeOp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'store'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bindGroup);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setVertexBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vertexBuffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 画 3 个顶点 = 1 个三角形</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device.queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">finish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>draw(vertexCount, instanceCount)</code> 的第二个参数是实例化绘制的入口——用一次绘制命令画出大量共享几何但参数不同的物体（如森林里的每棵树），这是减少绘制调用、提升性能的核心手段，在 <a href=\"../practice/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a> 里有专门展开。<code>drawIndexed</code> 则配合索引缓冲复用顶点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与画布的连接\">与画布的连接</h2><p>渲染管线最终要把像素呈现到页面上的 <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code>。这通过 canvas 的 <code>webgpu</code> 上下文完成：你先 <code>configure</code> 它（关联设备、声明像素格式、设置 alpha 模式），每帧用 <code>context.getCurrentTexture()</code> 拿到当前要绘制的纹理，把它作为渲染通道的颜色附件。呈现是隐式的——通道结束、命令提交后，浏览器自动把这帧合成到页面。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const context = canvas.getContext(&#39;webgpu&#39;);&#10;const presentationFormat = navigator.gpu.getPreferredCanvasFormat();&#10;context.configure({ device, format: presentationFormat, alphaMode: &#39;premultiplied&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'webgpu'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> presentationFormat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.gpu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPreferredCanvasFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">configure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ device, format: presentationFormat, alphaMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'premultiplied'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>getPreferredCanvasFormat()</code> 返回当前平台最优的纹理格式，应当用它而非硬编码——这是跨平台可移植性的小但重要的一环，与 <a href=\"../foundations/webgpu-overview\">WebGPU 概览与定位</a> 里强调的「显式协商能力」一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渲染管线是把整条「顶点→光栅化→片元」流水线的所有状态冻结成的不可变对象，换状态即换管线；这换来 WebGPU 可预测的性能行为。</li>\n<li>管线描述符的各部分与前面文档严格对接：顶点布局对齐 WGSL 的 <code>@location</code>、<code>layout</code> 对齐绑定组布局、<code>targets</code> 对齐渲染通道附件格式；<code>arrayStride</code>/<code>offset</code> 错位是最常见 bug。</li>\n<li>绘制发生在渲染通道内，命令序列固定为「设管线→设绑定组→设缓冲→draw」，最后经命令编码器提交给队列。</li>\n<li><code>draw</code> 的实例数参数与 <code>drawIndexed</code> 是减少绘制调用的关键，连接到性能优化篇；画布通过 <code>webgpu</code> 上下文配置并隐式呈现，格式应用 <code>getPreferredCanvasFormat</code>。</li>\n<li>渲染路径已完整打通，下一章转向 WebGPU 的另一半能力——把同样的资源与提交机制用于通用计算，见 <a href=\"../compute/compute-shaders\">计算着色器</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渲染管线与绘制","id":"渲染管线与绘制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"装配渲染管线","id":"装配渲染管线"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染通道与绘制命令","id":"渲染通道与绘制命令"},{"level":2,"text":"与画布的连接","id":"与画布的连接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"着色器与 WGSL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/rendering/shaders-wgsl"},"next":{"title":"计算着色器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/compute-shaders"}}